        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Resonance &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Alloyed Instinct</p><p><em>Two metals that never fully mixed, and a symbiont that never fully decided.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Choose a second colour. Electrum also <strong>counts as a Substrate of that colour</strong> for any effect that counts your bound Substrates of a colour; its Mass still counts toward Gold.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Electrum may stand in for <strong>either Substrate</strong> of any one Bond you know.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>You gain your second colour's <strong>Instinct clause</strong> as well &mdash; but both clauses operate at <strong>half value</strong> (round down, minimum 1).</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Both Instinct clauses operate at <strong>full value</strong>.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
